    <title>License — prodbytes.com</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="back-link" href="/">&larr; Back to all graphics</a>

    <main class="content">
      <h1>Prodbytes License</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <p>
        Every graphic on Prodbytes is free to download and use under the
        terms below. This isn't a formal legal document — just a clear,
        plain-language explanation of what you can and can't do.
      </p>

      <h2>You can</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Use any graphic for personal or commercial projects — websites, social media, articles, presentations, wallpaper, really anywhere</li>
        <li>Modify, crop, recolor, or combine graphics with your own work</li>
        <li>Use graphics in client work</li>
      </ul>
      <p>No attribution is required — though if you tag or share what you made, I'd genuinely love to see it.</p>

      <h2>You can't</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Resell or redistribute a graphic as-is (on a stock site, marketplace, or elsewhere) — the graphic itself isn't the product you're selling</li>
        <li>Claim a graphic as your own original design work in a way that misrepresents authorship</li>
