      <h2>No warranty</h2>
      <p>
        Graphics are provided as-is, with no guarantee of fitness for any
        particular purpose. Use your judgment for anything commercial or
        client-facing.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        If you're unsure whether your use case is covered, reach out at
        <a href="mailto:hello@timdwyer.co"> hello@timdwyer.co</a> — happy to clarify.
      </p>
    </main>

    <style>
      body {
        font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }
      .back-link {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem 0;
        color: #444;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }
      .content {
        max-width: 640px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .updated {
        color: #777;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        margin-top: -0.5rem;
      }
      h2 {
        margin-top: 2rem;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
      }
      a {
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }
